# Radiometric total-count gamma-ray color ramp — counts per second (cps).
# gdaldem color-relief format: <value> <r> <g> <b> [<a>]
# Sequential cmap (gamma counts are non-negative); transparent for nodata.
# Stops tuned for a typical CONUS aero-radiometric TC range (~0-3000 cps),
# with the upper tail biased toward known felsic / U-rich provinces
# (Marysvale volcanics, Bingham Canyon, granitic Sierra Nevada batholith).
#
# Adjust stops if the source GeoTIFF uses different units (eg µR/h,
# eU ppm, eTh ppm, K% — each ranges differently) or if the survey
# covers a province with a flatter or wilder dynamic range.

nv 0 0 0 0
   0 255 252 200 0
  50 255 252 200 180
 200 254 230 140 200
 500 254 200 90 215
1000 253 160 50 220
1500 240 110 30 225
2000 215 60 20 230
2500 170 20 30 235
3000 110 0 30 240
4000  60 0 30 245
